{%- comment -%}
  Renders a hex color for a given rarity tag value. Confirmed from Phase 0
  (Murder Mystery 2 only): Godly #E7592C, Ancient #C46CFF, Unique #FE5050.
  Every other game's rarity vocabulary was crawled (see
  PHASE_0_EXTRACTION_NOTES.md) but its *colors* were not individually
  sampled, so those fall back to the theme accent color below.

  TODO (Phase 8 data import): move this to a `custom.rarity_color` metafield
  set per product so merchandisers can adjust without a code deploy —
  this snippet is a placeholder until that metafield exists.

  Usage: {% render 'rarity-color', rarity: 'godly' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign key = rarity | downcase
  case key
    when 'godly'
      echo '#E7592C'
    when 'ancient'
      echo '#C46CFF'
    when 'unique'
      echo '#FE5050'
    else
      echo settings.color_accent
  endcase
-%}
